description.narrative:
The passing rate of USS graduates in the national university entrance examination increases from 70% in 2011 to 80% in 2019, and 40% of those passing are female. Achievement: 94.06 Progress/Status: Achieved.
Passing rate of USS graduates in the national examination for 2018/19 was 94.06%;
Of which 78.3% (including 51% female) of USS graduates applied for the national university entrance examination. Data Source: MOET's annual education statistics reports
